{
  "_how_this_works": "Each major is scored against the same fixed terms, whatever resume is used. anchors: the major's own name; a posting that says it almost always passes (in the title it scores 100%, in the description at least 90%). core: strong signs of the field, worth 3 points each. related: supporting terms, worth 1 point each. title_words: a posting whose title contains one gets a 25 point boost. 12 points of core and related terms together earn the full 75 points for content. queries: what is typed into Handshake's job search. Edit freely; terms are matched as whole words, ignoring case.",
